{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1773150895\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1773150895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1773150895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinevale Settlements is a colony-building simulator that blends production and defense. Start small, gather resources, construct buildings, automate production, research technologies, and keep your colony alive against ever-stronger raids.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coming in full release:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build \u2013 Defend \u2013 Expand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Create production chains from gatherers to workshops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Defend against raids with walls, towers, and patrols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Use new structures and efficiency bonuses through research</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic progression and challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Mitigate risks in seasonal cycles, counter increasing threat intensity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Manage resource bottlenecks, plan priorities and stocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Manage your colony and improve quality of life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Balance production panels, track stocks, upgrade structures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Plan workforce assignments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Begin exploration and expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Discover new regions, biomes, and opportunities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 - Make risk\u2013reward decisions: safe production or rapid growth?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap from Early Access to Full Release:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New maps, biomes, and game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Expanded technology tree, more buildings and defense types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quality of life improvements, production balancing, and performance optimizations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us, write your settlement's story, and keep Pinevale alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3157000?t=1773150895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/9727164460cf85327516ad908cdedde491950a3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773150895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/76b05a359e99920b1549bc9739e9704a522d7cbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773150895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/76b05a359e99920b1549bc9739e9704a522d7cbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773150895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1773150895\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1773150895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d371685